ral  gnomeus within himself  and then just release them onto the city  below hood is one of the strongest  things we've seen in this series so far  all thanks to the genius of dr garaki  taking the bronze medal on this list is  everyone's favorite hulk  gigantomachia machia was all for one's  loyal bodyguard over the years and he  has a naturally durable body  which meant that he could handle  multiple quirks without getting  remodeled by dr garaki  just to clarify this though because i  know just from reading comments on a  previous video  many people misinterpreted what dr  gracky said here  what the doctor is saying is that machia  was given multiple quirks  it's just that his body didn't have to  be altered in some way to handle them  i seriously had people like trying to  argue with me that he didn't have  multiple quirks one time  and every comment i read my mind was  just like this in one of the more recent  chapters in the manga debbie you know  full-on confirms this  and he says that giganto has a quirk  that transforms morale  into physical energy which is perfect  for someone who is just so enthusiastic  about shigaraki and all for one with  this power he has a really incredible  energy supply  which is why he can fight for an  impressive 48 hours straight  makia's body literally grows in battle  which is why he appears significantly  larger in recent chapters of the war  arc than he did when mina first  encountered him a couple years back  and in fact he even looks bigger than he  did at the start of my villain academia  additionally he has another quirk that  renders him impervious to feeling pain  and a ton more that just help him last  on the battlefield  this is of course without mentioning his  super senses which allow him to smell  shigeraki and track him down  seemingly regardless of how far away he  is there are a bunch of other  miscellaneous abilities related to his  body  such as his powerful breath his natural  durability and his crazy speed  especially for someone of his size  ultimately the guy is just a beast  and he would do anything to protect the  next character on this list  the silver medal goes to the original  symbol of evil and a guy who i  estimate is between 130 to 200 years old  all for one i'm gonna say straight up  that we have no idea  how many quirks this guy has cycled  through throughout the years  so i'm judging him based on what we've  seen naturally his original quirk is all  for one  which we already know what it does so no  need to talk about that a different  quirk that you might not know he has if  you don't read the manga  is life force so this doubles his  lifespan  and causes him to age at a much slower  rate  this is how he's been able to survive  since pretty much the first generation  of quirk users  all the way up to present day society in  my career academia  life force does have a drawback though  which is that the user sacrifices their  physical ability and their athleticism  however we saw during the anime that all  for one has several strength enhancing  and strength multiplying quirks  which likely override this drawback a  younger all for one also possessed a  quirk that let him nuke an  entire island which is how he was able  to kill all might's master  nana shimura as you've seen he also has  a warping quirk that lets him transfer  people  to and from his location or to the  location of someone he's familiar with  but as he said he does need more  practice with this quirk  perhaps one of his most impressive  abilities is air cannon  so this produces a really powerful shock  wave and when it's combined with quirks  like spring-like limbs  it was enough to completely wreck the  surrounding environment  during the big battle look how it  changes the landscape in this moment  from this  to this like that's pretty damn powerful  forcible quirk activation is another  favorite of his  and it lives up to its name pretty well  by activating the quirk of whoever it  stabs  and allowing all for one to control that  quirk this was best seen when all for  one used  on kiragiri and then created portals  based on his own desires  so this kind of shows us that when all  for one uses this quirk he's basically  using people as a puppet when he does  this  the tendrils from the quirk can also be  used to strike other people and just  throw them around  as we see in this hilarious clip as if  all that wasn't enough  he has another quirk which he calls air  walk and it allows him to levitate in  mid-air  though this is very similar to the  description of nana shimura's float  quirk  and it kind of makes you think because  he is the one that killed her and you  know he was there when her when she died  so who knows maybe this is the result of  some experimentation or just  straight up stealing her quirk who knows  all for one also recently stole the  search quirk  which was taken from ragdoll and i think  this one needs a bit more explaining  than the others  ragdoll said in the manga that she has  to lay eyes on someone for this search  quirk to activate  and once that happens the data of that  person is then stored inside the quirk  forever  even when it's passed on to another  person for example  because she used search on deku and a  bunch of other ua students  all for one is now able to track those  students down using the search quirk  essentially the power lets the user  observe and monitor the location  of up to 100 people at a time and you  can know their weaknesses on top of that  we see in the manga that people being  monitored using this quirk  almost look like shining stars in the  distance and when the user is looking  for a specific quirk  the person with that power shines  brighter than the others  the only thing we don't currently know  is how far this power extends like  how far away can you search for someone  afo also has a hypertrophy quirk  which increases the size of his arms i  mean just look at how massive his hand  is here  we see him use this in my academia  vigilantes to attack knuckle duster  and in the main anime he combined it  with a bunch of other abilities such as  bone spear  in a final attempt to kill all might so  with all that said you're probably  wondering who could possibly be in the  number one spot  if a guy like afo isn't and believe me i  have good justification for the order of  this ranking  tomorrow shiguraki is all for one  successor and is the new possessor  of the original all for one quirk his  body has been genetically modified to  such an extent  that dr karaki referred to him as his  masterpiece  think about that the creator of the  higher nomus the usg nomu  and you know obviously he would have  tinkled around with author one himself  over the years  i mean above all of that lie shigaraki  there are two key reasons why i've  ranked him above all for one  firstly his base strength is pretty  comparable to all might  and in chapter 274 this was shown when  shiggy started casually jumping around  like the man himself as far as we know  he has all the quirks that all for one  had you know we've seen him use air  cannon we've seen him use search  so it's fair to assume that all the  other quirks i mentioned all for one  having  shigaraki also has those as well his  decay quirk is now capable  of destroying entire cities with a  single action and his super regeneration  power  puts him just leagues above the reason  afo looked like a potato  is because he never had super  regeneration shigaraki in his prime can  already do that  making him essentially all for one but  with a software upgrade  secondly we've seen in the manga that  shigaraki has inherited the  instincts of all for one himself so this  means that he can easily combine quirks  to suit his knees such as when we saw  him use air cannon  in conjunction with radio waves in order  to disable the hero's communication  systems  because all for one contained these  instincts i mean the learning curve  is not that steep so again at the very  least he's equal to all for one  but in all likelihood you know over time  he will become even more proficient than  the man himself  there's just too much going in chicago's  favor for him not to be ranked number  one on this list  but that is just my opinion let me know  if you're on the same wavelength  i know some people might say you know we  need more feats from shigaraki  but i feel like i mean he's decayed two  different cities at this point  uh and that's without even using all the  tons of other quirks that he has  i just feel like shiggy he is number one  but let me know what you guys think  and if you want to see those two new  episodes of my hero academia  be sure to head on over to  crunchyroll.com to get your two week  free trial  of crunchyroll premium peace out guys
 

